          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>The engineering behind it</h2>
        <p>
          P2P Media Loader is built and maintained by Novage. Read the{" "}
          <a href="/case-studies/p2p-media-loader">case study</a> for how its
          architecture evolved over eight years, the key engineering decisions
          behind it, and what we're building next.
        </p>

        <LeadBlock title="Need help integrating or scaling P2P Media Loader?">
          The team behind P2P Media Loader integrates it into your players and
          apps, builds custom P2P CDNs, runs tracker infrastructure, and
          supports it all in production. We also take on the complete
          development cycle for other products — product design, development,
          QA, and delivery.
        </LeadBlock>
      </div>
    </article>
    <ContactBanner />
  </div>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
